# Line endings (QUEUE Q156): text files are stored and checked out with LF on every machine, whatever core.autocrlf
# says. Without this, a CRLF copy could be committed from Windows and then every merge with an LF copy conflicts on the
# whole file (it happened to NOTES.md twice on 2026-10-09).
*.md   text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
